{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_06_beg","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":13,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_05_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-6","storyName":"倒带独白","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"格蕾塔意识到卢西恩的眼光不仅聚焦于戏中，更投向戏外，她正式邀请卢西恩成为“主演”，解决地块上发生的事件。而卢西恩做的第一步，就是揪出连环凶案的凶手——莫伊拉。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_06","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":11,"next":13,"characters":["莫伊拉","格蕾塔","卢西恩","？？？"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_bg_bg_lungmencommand.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_energywell","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"en","id":7},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"en","fadetime":"2","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"漆黑一片的楼层里，身形娇小的札拉克女孩独自摸索着。","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"嗯......原来如此。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"虽然构造和系统看上去很复杂，但只要搞清楚原理......","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$2","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"就算是小小的道具师也能操作。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"比如这里，先调整一下方向......","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_keyboard_console","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"key","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":21},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"key","fadetime":"1","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$2","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"设置好时间，再扳下拉杆，打开闸口，然后......","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"成了。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#10$2","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"嗯，跟我想的完全一致。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9F/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"这样一来就算发生意料之外的事情......也不用担心了。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9F/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$2","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"现在，只剩下最后一件事......","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我要去找她。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"en","fadetime":"2","id":35},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"charslot","id":37},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_bg_62_g10_dormitory.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":38},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":39,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":40},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我知道你有顾虑，卢西恩。","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"现在地块上危机重重，人人自危，一个不管不顾撂下狠话要将拍摄进行下去的制片人，怎么看都不是值得信任的对象。","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我们之间无需信任。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"呵......没错。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"在蓝卡坞从业二十年，我从来没有信任过任何合作伙伴，我相信的只有自己的眼光。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我在米兰妮最需要机会的时候发出邀约，我在拍卖会上一眼看出你是演戏奇才，我吃准阿布纳恨我但还是会加入剧组。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"......我还确信五年前劳拉之死是挽救电影的唯一解。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你与那起意外并无关联，但你利用了她的死。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"劳拉是个有天分的新人。她好学、勤奋、对电影充满热情，只是有时候积极得过了头，破坏了一些规矩。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"当时斯蒂芬经验浅薄，拍摄并没有达到预期的效果。项目进行到中途，我就意识到这部电影一定会掏空我的资产，甚至葬送我的声誉。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我需要“场外因素”帮我渡过这次危机......","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"劳拉的坠亡。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"用媒体炒作片场故事缺乏意义，好事者只会唏嘘几句，转头就会遗忘。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"所以我花重金压下了警方的调查和电视台对此的关注，给劳拉的家人一笔可观的抚恤金......","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"让剪辑师完整保留了阿布纳拍摄的坠亡片段，故意做成剧中的一幕高潮......","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"到现在还有人认为她是早早息影的天才演员......","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你隐瞒了她的死。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我让她在电影中永生。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"总有人会注意到你的手段。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"每年劳拉的祭日，我都会去看望她。五年过去，她的墓前只有我带去的花。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你毫不愧疚？","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我难辞其咎。但忏悔，不是现在。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"此时此刻我最想做的只有一件事——把电影拍完。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"等《杜邦夫人之死》上映后，拍摄中发生的几起命案势必会引来媒体的关注，我也会借此正式公开劳拉死亡的真相。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"到时候会有更多人为她悼念，而我将承担我应承担的罪责。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你应该明白，刚刚的自我坦陈并非有感而发。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你想用自己的真相跟我交易。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"遇见你之初我还以为是命运的垂青，为我即将开拍的电影送来一份大礼。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"然而你进组后的种种表现，让我确认你的身份异于常人。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"老道尔顿死在你的面前，你神情镇定，甚至还期待之后的拍摄。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"找到我打算拍摄天灾的线索之后，你将它在绝妙的时机分享给最会传播消息的摄影助理。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"现在，剧组正式解散，几乎所有人都陷入绝境，而你却在房间内等待我的拜访，仿佛早已习惯突如其来的悲剧和死亡。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你到底是谁，你到底为什么答应加入剧组？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我只是被你拍下的剧本吸引，别无二因。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"或许吧。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"事到如今盘问你的来历也无助于我的拍摄，但我希望我的坦诚也能换来你的坦诚。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"卢西恩先生，我相信自己的眼光，就算我在你身上发现了无数可疑之处，我依然不会收回向你发出的主演邀约。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"但是——","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"如果你真正的目的无法明说，如果你的视角远高于我......","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"如果你认为劳拉之死，以及五年后由此引发的一切，才是这个地块上真正在拍摄的“故事”，而你正是为此而来......","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"格蕾塔·斯通愿意再一次向你发出邀请......","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"去成为接下来的“主演”吧，卢西恩先生。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"如你所愿......如我所愿，格蕾塔女士。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":118},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":119},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":120},{"type":"charslot","id":121},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":122},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":123},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_darkforest","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":124},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":125},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":126},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":127},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“......格蕾塔......结算了所有人的酬劳，正式解散了整个剧组......”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":128},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“畏惧凶手的，忌惮天灾的，坚持拍摄的......都可以任意决定自己的去留，各行其是。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":129},{"type":"subtitle","text":"坚持拍摄？格蕾塔到现在还想着自己的电影？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":130},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她不可能猜不到剧组的凶案与五年前的命案有关。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":131},{"type":"subtitle","text":"所以，她是故意的......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":132},{"type":"subtitle","id":133},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"1","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":135},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“深层原因？在这种情况下难道还有人想要追寻真相吗？”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":136},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“或者，按照格蕾塔的说法——把真相交给想当侦探的好事者吧。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":137},{"type":"subtitle","text":"真相？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":138},{"type":"subtitle","text":"剧组成员明目张胆欺凌新人，制片人还将坠亡的悲剧包装成似真似假的戏。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":139},{"type":"subtitle","text":"既不为五年前的事忏悔，也不将自己的所作所为公之于众......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":140},{"type":"subtitle","text":"格蕾塔，难道你自认为是无辜的吗？难道你忘了被你剪到电影里一遍遍死去的劳拉了吗？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":141},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你必须付出代价。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":142},{"type":"subtitle","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":144},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","volume":"0.3","id":145},{"type":"bg","id":146,"from":"0","to":"0.5","duration":"0.1","block":"false"},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_bg_62_g10_dormitory.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":147},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":149},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wtchkgopenftstp","volume":"0.8","loop":"true","channel":"wt","id":150},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"wt","fadetime":"2","id":151},{"type":"bg","id":152,"from":"0.5","to":"0","duration":"3","block":"false"},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":153},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1","yScaleTo":"1.1","yFrom":"0","yTo":"50","duration":"3","block":"false","id":154},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"借着夜灯微弱的光，隐约能看到床上的隆起。蒙在被中的人还在安稳的睡梦中，对审判的到来一无所知。","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"安稳？羞辱逝者，遗忘罪孽，无视警告......格蕾塔凭什么能睡得安稳？","id":159},{"type":"dialog","id":160},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drawsword","volume":"1","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"一个人悄无声息地接近床头，衣袖滑出一把锋利的匕首。纤细的手指死死抓住刀柄，将凶器高高举起。","id":163},{"type":"text","text":"连忏悔都不想听到，连哀鸣都觉得刺耳，就这样消失吧，付出代价吧！","id":164},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":166},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"0.7","id":167},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.3","duration":"0.8","block":"false","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":169},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.8","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_knife","volume":"1","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":174},{"type":"background","id":175},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_bg_62_g10_dormitory.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":176},{"type":"curtain","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"触感不对......","id":178},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"e","fadetime":"2","id":180},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":181},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"false","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","bstart":"0.7","bend":"1","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":184},{"type":"text","text":"被子被一把掀开，里面空无一人，只有黑色的影子。","id":185},{"type":"text","text":"影子？影子怎么会凭空出现？","id":186},{"type":"text","text":"来人向后退了几步，影子慢慢凝聚成了熟悉的样子。","id":187},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_meowlong","volume":"1","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":191},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_catfootstep","volume":"1","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#2$1","duration":"0.2","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":195},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cakebgflgrnd","volume":"1","id":196},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......Miss.Christine？","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"陷阱......","id":199},{"type":"dialog","id":200},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"0.5","id":201},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlight","volume":"1","id":202},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":204},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"0.5","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":205},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"1.5","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"终于见面了。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#11$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"欢迎你，神出鬼没的客人。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"真的是......你？","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":217},{"type":"charslot","id":218},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_sys_rglk1phantomcastle_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/rogue_1/m_sys_rglk1phantomcastle_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":219,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$2","duration":"2","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#3$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"莫伊拉......剧组里最敬业的成员，你真的是三起命案的凶手......","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$2","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"本应该是四起。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"......","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$2","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"卢西恩先生，你是什么时候发现的？","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"最先发现你反常之处的不是我，是Miss.Christine。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我进组的第一场戏，Miss.Christine闯入拍摄现场。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"除了我之外，她一般不会主动靠近别人，但她接近了你。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"从那以后，她与你接触了很多次。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"蒂比认为Miss.Christine特地跑到道具间陪你们一起看电影是因为喜欢你们......","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"这话对了一半。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"Miss.Christine只是对你感兴趣。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你看现在......尽管你手里还握着凶器，她还是在你身边。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"charslot","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$2","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#5$1","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#3$2","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.5","id":248},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"！","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#7$2","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"荒唐......","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"难道你就凭这只神秘生物的喜好来推测凶手吗！","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#13$2","focus":"r","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"还是说作为你的宠物，她奉行的是你的意旨......","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":257},{"type":"text","text":"莫伊拉对上Miss.Christine深邃的蓝眼睛。","id":258},{"type":"text","text":"下一秒，她的意识不再受自己支配。","id":259},{"type":"text","text":"喜悦、悲伤、愤怒，种种情绪在心中翻涌，最终变为一片空白，空虚得令人恐惧。","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你对Miss.Christine依旧存有误解。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我曾解释过，没人能干涉Miss.Christine的意愿与行动。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"这句话的意思，并不是指Miss.Christine天性自由，而是指没有人“有能力”干涉她。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#11$1","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"她才是“有能力”左右他人的那一个。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_meowlong","volume":"1","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"神秘的黑色生物若无其事地舔着爪子。","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"莫伊拉很难将现在的Miss.Christine与刚刚自己所受的巨大压力联系在一起。","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"Miss.Christine对情绪感知十分敏锐——强行掩饰的痛苦、转瞬即逝的邪念......都会引起她的注意。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"在漫长的时间里，她走遍泰拉的各个角落，品尝过万千的喜怒哀乐......","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"比起某种单一的情感，Miss.Christine更偏爱杂糅的情绪。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"她的判断出于本能而非逻辑，绝无可能出错。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"在没有发现任何作案动机的情况下破解了凶案......我该恭喜你吗，卢西恩先生？","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#3$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"复仇。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#13$2","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"为谁？","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#4$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"为缠绕在剧组大多数人心头的那个幽灵。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"......","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"格蕾塔女士，现在站在你面前的是五年前坠亡的新人演员劳拉的亲人——","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"深爱着她的，妹妹。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":294},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":296},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":297},{"type":"charslot","id":298},{"type":"background","id":299},{"type":"image","id":300}],"characters":["莫伊拉","格蕾塔","卢西恩","？？？"]}